@M_KOJO_EN_EVENT_K93_MYSTERYBUBBLES_BUY(ARGS, ARG, ARG:1)
PRINTL
IF CFLAG:93:面識 == 0 ;this checks if you have met waggy yet via her acquaintance flag
	PRINTFORMDW You set the newly bought [Mystery Bubbles] down.
	PRINTFORMDW It's just a big, solid bubble supported by what looks like seafoam underneath.
	PRINTFORMDL It doesn't seem to do much, just standing there...
	PRINTFORMDW ...!
	PRINTFORMDW It perks up a few inches off the ground, scuttling away at speeds barely perceptible to the untrained eye.
	PRINTL
	PRINTFORMDL You can't help but feel sad about the waste of money, you haven't even paid for it yet!
	CALL PRINT_STRW, @"@ITALIC@But you're sure someone \@ GROUPMATCH(GET_MAPID(CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置), 7, 8) ? downstream # somewhere \@ is grateful for it...@"
	PRINTFORMDW So it is what it is.
ELSE
	IF CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置 == CFLAG:93:現在位置 ;you and waggy in the same spot
		CALL PRINT_FACE, 93, "通常", "服", "", ""
		PRINTFORML 「%K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%, what is this?」
	ENDIF
	PRINTFORMDW You put down your newly acquired [Mystery Bubbles].
	PRINTFORMDL It's a water bubble that doesn't seem to burst or spill no matter what you do to it.
	PRINTFORMDW Upon closer inspection, the "foam" you see under it is, in truth, a colony of tiny insect-like creatures with frog-like feet.
	IF CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置 == CFLAG:93:現在位置
		PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% seems to be just as curious about it as you are.
		PRINTFORML 「%K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%, if you would allow me...」
	ELSE
		PRINTFORMDW There's someone who would make great use of this!
		PRINTL
		PRINTFORMDW You ride your newly acquired product %COND_STR("downstream", GROUPMATCH(GET_MAPID(CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置), 7, 8))% at exceptional speeds, arriving at the Misty Lake in no time at all.
		PRINTL
		TIME += 15
		CALL PRINT_FACE, 93, "通常", "服", "", ""
		PRINTW
		PRINTFORMW 「Oh, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%, you came!」
		PRINTFORMDL %HE_SHE(93, 1)% greets you with a radiating grin.
		PRINTFORMDW You dismount off your watery steed and offer it to %K93NICK()%.
	ENDIF
	PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% crawls over to the [Mystery Bubbles], swimming inside, through, and out of the top of it.
	PRINTL
	IF MARK:93:反発刻印 >= 3 ;one or more hatemark
		PRINTFORMDL %HE_SHE(93, 1)% looks down at %HIS_HER(93, 0)% submerged tail.
		PRINTFORML 「Fwuuuh... Even after what you to did to me...」
		MARK:93:反発刻印 --
		CALL COLORMESSAGE(@"%CALLNAME:93% seems to have forgiven you, even if just a little.",C_GREEN, 2)
		PRINTL
		PRINTFORMDW This time %HE_SHE(93, 0)% shifts %HIS_HER(93, 0)% look to somewhere else in the distance.
		PRINTFORMW 「May you go? I need some time alone.」
		PRINTFORML 「And %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%?」
		PRINTFORMDW You turn to face %HIM_HER(93, 0)%.
		PRINTFORMW 「I am truly, truly grateful for this.」
	ELSEIF K93_YEARNING_SEXFRIEND() ;yearning OR sex friends
		PRINTFORMDL %HE_SHE(93, 1)% looks up, wearing the brightest grin %HE_SHE(93, 0)% has ever graced you with.
		PRINTFORML 「%K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%! You did not have to do this!」
		PRINTFORMDL %HE_SHE(93, 1)% brings you closer for a warm embrace, further displaying %HIS_HER(93, 0)% appreciation with a kiss on your cheek.
		PRINTFORMW 「Chuuu～...! I will be forever grateful to you, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%.」
		PRINTL
		PRINTFORMDW You ask %K93NICK()% if %HE_SHE(93, 0)% needs anything else.
		IF CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置 == CFLAG:93:現在位置
			PRINTFORML 「Not right now, except for your continued company.」
			PRINTFORMW 「But we still have things to do here, don't we?」
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMW 「Not right now, you may go if you need to.」
			PRINTFORMDW You say that you still have things to do, so you turn around to walk upstream again as you have yet to pay for the gift.
			PRINTFORMW 「Hmhmmm, but can you promise to come and visit me later?」
			PRINTFORMDW You tell %HIM_HER(93, 0)% it's a promise.
			PRINTL
			CFLAG:93:好感度 += 500
			CFLAG:93:信頼度 += 110
			CALL COLORMESSAGE(@"%CALLNAME:93% has grown even closer to you...",C_GREEN, 2)
		ENDIF
	ELSEIF K93_LOVE_LUST_LOVER() ;love OR lust
		PRINTFORMDL Then, without a moment's hesitation, %K93NICK()% lunges on top of you, arms open ablaze with joy.
		PRINTFORMDW As %HE_SHE(93, 0)% holds you in %HIS_HER(93, 0)% arms, that warmth is only eclipsed by the feeling of being utterly cherished by %HIS_HER(93, 0)%.
		PRINTFORMW 「You've already done so much...! What can I even give you in return?」
		PRINTFORMDW You tell %HIM_HER(93, 0)% that you only have %HIS_HER(93, 0)% company to ask for.
		PRINTFORMW 「I will always be by your side, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%. No matter what.」
		PRINTFORMDW But you already know that.
		PRINTL
		IF CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置 == CFLAG:93:現在位置
			PRINTFORML 「But say, I think we have another problem now.」
			PRINTFORMW 「I think I have grown too accustomed to you carrying me around.」
			PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% blushes profusely.
			PRINTFORML 「Will you promise to still do that, sometimes?」
			PRINTFORMDW You promise %HIM_HER(93, 0)% that you'll do so.
			PRINTFORMW 「Good! But while I'm happy to hear that... shouldn't we pay for this first?」
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMW 「...Do you have anywhere to be right now?」
			PRINTFORMDW You say that you still have to go back and pay for the gift, but you'll come back.
			PRINTFORMW 「I shall await for your return, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%.」
			PRINTFORMDW You tell %HIM_HER(93, 0)% it's a promise.
		ENDIF
		PRINTL
		CFLAG:93:好感度 += 1200
		CFLAG:93:信頼度 += 730
		CALL COLORMESSAGE(@"%CALLNAME:93%'s love for you has grown even more...",C_GREEN, 2)
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMDL %K93NICK()% looks back at you.
			PRINTFORMW 「Even though we barely know each other, you are giving me this...」
			PRINTFORMDL %HIS_HER(93, 1)% smile wanes, exchanged for an expression of curiosity.
			PRINTFORMW 「I can't help but ask myself... "Why"?」
			PRINTFORMDL %HIS_HER(93, 1)% then expression returns to one of a pure smile.
			PRINTFORMW 「%K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%, I am indebted to you.」
			PRINTFORMDW You tell %HIM_HER(93, 0)% it was no biggie.
			PRINTL
			IF CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置 == CFLAG:93:現在位置
				PRINTFORML 「But don't you still have to pay for this?」
				PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% cheerfully giggles.
			ELSE
				PRINTFORML 「I assume you have businesses to attend to.」
				PRINTFORMDL You tell %HIM_HER(93, 0)% that you still have to pay for the [Mystery Bubbles].
				PRINTFORMW 「Then I shall leave you to it. But do visit me again, hmm?」
				PRINTFORMDW You don't promise anything, but you say you'll try.
			ENDIF
			PRINTL
			CFLAG:93:好感度 += 125
			CFLAG:93:信頼度 += 20
			ABL:93:親密 ++
			CALL COLORMESSAGE(@"%CALLNAME:93% grows closer to you...",C_GREEN, 2)
		ENDIF
	PRINTW
	TALENT:機嫌 = 1
	IF CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置 == CFLAG:93:現在位置
		PRINTFORMDW You turn towards the kappa, handing her payment for the [Mystery Bubbles].
	ELSE
		PRINTFORMDW You make your way back to the kappa, as you still have to pay for the [Mystery Bubbles].
	ENDIF
	PRINTL
ENDIF
CFLAG:93:K93EN_BUBBLEREFUND ++ ;deactivate the one time refund if the player is buying it this playthrough
RETURN 1

