	PRINTFORML 「B-but I already paid so much for it...」
	PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% seems to be upset by the sudden billing.
ENDIF
PRINTFORMDW It is what it is.
CFLAG:93:K93EN_HARNESSREFUND ++ ;deactivate the one time refund if the player is buying it this playthrough
