CASE 0 ;daily greeting
	PRINTFORMW 「%K93_DAYGREET()%, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%.」
	PRINTFORMW 「Before we talk any further, there is something I want to tell you.」
	PRINTFORM 「Thinking about the all sights you have shown me
