	PRINTFORML 「Say, I have a gift to give you...」
	PRINTFORMW 「But first, would you mind inching a bit closer?」
CASE 2 ;returning for a date
	PRINTFORML 「Say, I have a special gift to give you for such a nice date...」
	PRINTFORMW 「But I first, I need you to lean in a bit closer.」
CASE 3 ;from a request
	PRINTFORMW 「We would get going now, but you need a way to breathe underwater like I do...」
	IF ITEM:空色の勾玉 || ITEM:酸素マスク || TALENT:MASTER:水棲 ;magatama, gas mask or aquatic
		PRINTFORML 「Oh, you already can? Well, I would still like to give you this.」
		PRINTFORMW 「If not as a gift, then consider it an extra reward.」
	ELSE
		PRINTFORMW 「Luckily, I have something just for that!」
	ENDIF
	PRINTFORMW 「But first, would you mind leaning closer to me?」
ENDSELECT
PRINTFORMDW Heeding %K93NICK()%'s request, you lean your head lower.
PRINTFORMW 「There, now hold still for a second...」
PRINTFORMDL You feel a lukewarm string wrapping itself to your neck, a faint snap accompanying it.
PRINTFORMDW A silvery chain with a simple yet fairly thick clasp, a metallic sphere hanging as its charm.
PRINTFORMW 「Look, it ended up looking so nice on you, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%～!」
ITEM:避水の玉 ++ ;waterproof sphere
CALL COLORMESSAGE(@"※ Received [Waterproof Sphere]!", C_GREEN, 2)
PRINTFORMW 「%K93_HONORIFIC(63)% and %K93_HONORIFIC(73)% each have one like this as well.」
PRINTFORMW 「This allows anyone to breathe underwater, just like me!」
PRINTFORMW 「I was told to only give it to someone very special, and you see...」
IF K93_LOVE_LUST_LOVER() ;it would be borderline impossible for the player to get this as a non lust lover, but better be safe than sorry
	PRINTFORML 「It's fair to say that you're that special someone, correct?」
	PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% grins from ear to ear, %HIS_HER(93, 0)% cheeks pressing %HIS_HER(93, 0)% eyes closed.
ELSEIF GETBIT(FLAG:プール, 3)
	PRINTFORMDL %K93NICK()% shyly looks away from you, a subtle blush forming on %HIS_HER(93, 0)% cheeks.
	PRINTFORMW 「It's only fair that I give you something proper in return for the [Mystery Bubbles] isn't it?」
ELSE
	PRINTFORMDL %K93NICK()%'s face burns in a deep, reddish pink as %HE_SHE(93, 0)% desperately turns %HIS_HER(93, 0)% gaze away from you.
	IF LS_ACTIVE() == "Scarlet"
		PRINTFORMW 「...Well, it's a special situation, isn't it?」
	ELSE
		PRINTFORMW 「F-forget that I said anything, it's just a gift that I wanted you to have!」
		PRINTFORMW 「Please, use it to visit me whenever you feel like it!」
	ENDIF
	PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% takes a deep breath, %HIS_HER(93, 0)% cheeks returning to a paler color.
ENDIF

